        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The central scene of this panel depicts Elkanah with his wives, Penninah and Hannah-the older of the two and mother to the prophet Samuel. The now faint inscription \"XI\" on the doorway lintel of the house in the background refers to Samuel 1:11 in which Hannah prays for a male child."@en ;
